DESCRIPTION:A Thousand Lives are our Village Church men’s ministry events
 \, where we gather a few times a year to eat\, encourage one another and d
 ive into difficult discussions together. A Thousand Lives is for guys of a
 ll ages\, from youth to grey hairs. A part of the vision (it’s in the na
 me) is that we want to be growing together\, by sharing our lives closely 
 with one another\, in a culture where it’s increasingly rare for guys to
  walk closely with one another. Join the men of Village for a brekky toget
 her. There will be time to chat but also to spend a bit of time thinking a
 bout Titus 2 together\, and what it has to say to us today as men.\n\nSour
 ce: https://www.vc.org.au/events/\nRegister: https://villagechurchbne.chur
 chsuite.com/events/v78bynwe
