SUMMARY:Kelvin Grove Playgroup
LOCATION:The Exchange Community Centre\, 81 Musk Ave\, Kelvin Grove
DESCRIPTION:Do you want to meet other parents from the Kelvin Grove communi
 ty and give your children a fun and safe playtime? Every Friday morning 
 – during the school term – mums and dads\, along with their little one
 s\, from Village Church and the wider community get together to sing\, rea
 d stories\, play games and do craft together. We love kids and love gettin
 g to know other parents in the community. All people are always welcome!\n
 \nSource: https://www.vc.org.au/events/\nContact: playgroup@vc.org.au\nOcc
 urs every Friday during school term. The site does not publish term dates\
 ; the recurring rule is intentionally not term-bounded.
